<title>JAPAN: Japan to give go-ahead for Lloyd's operation - MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan to give go-ahead for Lloyd's operation - MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan will give Lloyd's of London formal permission on Thursday to start selling insurance policies in Japan, a Japanese Ministry of Finance (MOF) official told reporters on Thursday.</p>
<p>An official announcement would be made later in the day, the official said.</p>
</text>
